            "zh-TW": "在壓倒性勝選之後，新市長為上任百日定下了雄心勃勃的計畫。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Several immigrants describe the paperwork for citizenship as overwhelming without legal aid.",
          "highlight": [
            "overwhelming"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "幾位移民說，沒有法律援助，公民身分文件負擔令人應接不暇。"
          }
        }
